 "voice": "af_heart",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "First check? It's just six spots.",
   "start": 0.12,
   "end": 1.985
  },
  {
   "text": "A check is a note to your bank: pay this person.",
   "start": 2.185,
   "end": 4.826
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot one, top right: today's date.",
   "start": 5.126,
   "end": 7.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot two, pay to the order of: who gets the money.",
   "start": 7.55,
   "end": 10.383
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot three: the amount in numbers. Squeeze it right up against the dollar sign,",
   "start": 10.683,
   "end": 15.271
  },
  {
   "text": "so this sneaky raccoon can't sneak an extra number in.",
   "start": 15.351,
   "end": 18.424
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot four: the same amount, in words. Eight hundred fifty, and zero zero over one hundred.",
   "start": 18.774,
   "end": 24.359
  },
  {
   "text": "Then draw a line to the end, so nobody can add more.",
   "start": 24.509,
   "end": 27.393
  },
  {
   "text": "Secret: if the words and the numbers don't match, the bank usually trusts the words. So make them match.",
   "start": 27.743,
   "end": 33.521
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot five, the memo: what it's for, like your apartment number. It's optional.",
   "start": 33.921,
   "end": 38.116
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot six, the big one: sign your name. No signature, no money.",
   "start": 38.416,
   "end": 42.229
  },
  {
   "text": "Always use a pen, and never sign a blank check. That's like handing the raccoon your piggy bank.",
   "start": 42.579,
   "end": 47.875
  },
  {
   "text": "The numbers at the bottom are your bank's routing number and your account number. Leave them alone.",
   "start": 48.225,
   "end": 53.024
  },
  {
   "text": "Six spots, and you just wrote a check. Which spot was new to you?",
   "start": 53.374,
   "end": 56.891
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow for more grown-up stuff.",
   "start": 57.141,
   "end": 58.743
  },
  {
   "text": "So next time your landlord says, just write me a check...",
   "start": 58.993,
   "end": 61.812
  }
 ],
